do_1 = "Create the @hypermind/console workspace package that every later view task extends, and prove it against a real daemon. The package has two compilation targets from one flat src/: CommonJS into dist/ for node --test, and ES2022 modules into dist/site/ for the browser, plus a checked-in src/index.html shell copied into dist/site by a tiny build script. src/transport.ts declares ConsoleEnvelope and ConsoleTransport and ships the browser restTransport over POST /v1/{verb}; src/node-transport.ts ships clientTransport wrapping @hypermind/client's Client.callTool and is excluded from the browser build."
do_2 = "The first view is the overview: buildOverview turns an inspect envelope with no uri into actor identity, applied LSN, log size, MMR verification and per-projection checkpoints, and renderOverview renders it as escaped HTML. src/app.ts is the browser entry that wires restTransport to the overview section; later tasks append their sections to it. The test starts a real hm serve daemon, writes real records through the real client, and asserts the overview against the daemon's own numbers."
